OL,3,GNEWSA'I just turned into a robot,' CPR
OL,4,Alifesaver says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gym worker has said he switched into
OL,7,Fautomatic mode when he successfully
OL,8,Fperformed CPR on a client for nearly
OL,9,Fhalf an hour.
OL,11,FPete Tonkin, now aged 63, suffered a
OL,12,Fcardiac arrest at the Queen's Park gym
OL,13,Fin Bournemouth in February 2025.
OL,15,FTom Guest, 25, said he worked on him
OL,16,Ffor 26 minutes before paramedics
OL,17,Farrived.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
