OL,3,GNEWSA'I just turned into a robot,' CPR
OL,4,Alifesaver says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "There was crowds of people
OL,7,Faround and... I had comments telling me
OL,8,Fit didn't seem like it was me in
OL,9,Fcontrol, it was just robotic actions
OL,10,Fand following through with what you've
OL,11,Ftrained for."
